    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"period\" though. it feels permanent. everything i cared about, the way things used to be... it's just gone. i feel like a relic. like a chapter in a book that's already been closed. there's no point in trying to \"find my way back\" when there's nothing to go back to. the world is just too loud and too new now. i'm just tired of trying to pretend i fit.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
